"privacy.title" = "Privacy Policy";
"privacy.headline" = "Your steps are yours.";
"privacy.body" = "Walkuno, published by Orbelio, works without an account or tracking server. It only reads the steps, walking/running distance, active energy, exercise time and flights climbed you authorize in Apple Health. It never writes measurements to Health or sends health data to Orbelio, analytics services or advertising networks. There are no ads or trackers.";
"privacy.permissions" = "Apple manages permissions. Change them in Health → your profile → Apps and Services → Walkuno. Missing measurements do not tell Walkuno whether you denied access.";
"privacy.widgets" = "Your full history stays in Health. Charts are calculated in memory. A bounded local cache contains seven recent daily totals, hourly profiles, daily summaries for the current and previous month, and monthly aggregates for two years with Pro. It is excluded from backups and protected while your device is locked. Widget measurements are marked sensitive. iPhone–Watch communication carries goals and display preferences, never health measurements.";
"privacy.purchases" = "Apple processes purchases. Walkuno verifies entitlements with StoreKit and never receives your payment details. Preferences and goals are saved locally. Walkuno does not sync health data to iCloud.";
"privacy.reset" = "Settings lets you erase local data. This does not change Apple Health, cancel subscriptions or revoke permissions managed by Apple. Walkuno is a wellness application with no medical diagnostic function.";
"privacy.editor" = "Orbelio · Policy dated November 5, 2026 · Version 1.1";
